OL,3,ATrump waives several Russia sanctions
OL,4,Aas row with Zelensky intensifies
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS Secretary of State Marco Rubio said
OL,7,Fon Saturday that the suspension would
OL,8,Fconsist of a 60-day pause intended to
OL,9,Fanalyse the impact on the global
OL,10,Feconomy.
